# Unblock Deploy without asking

When a merge to `main` is stuck because App CI cancelled/hung (especially
Backend pytest) and Deploy is skipped, **do not ask** whether to re-run CI or
`workflow_dispatch` Deploy.

## Do this automatically

1. Cancel any still-hanging App CI runs if needed.
2. Re-run App CI on `main` for the merge SHA (`gh run rerun … --failed` or
   equivalent).
3. Watch until **App CI success**; confirm Deploy auto-starts.
4. If App CI cannot go green in a reasonable window (repeat hang/timeout) but
   the merge must ship: **`workflow_dispatch` Deploy** for that SHA (allowed
   emergency path in `deploy.yml` — not a merge). Prefer this when frontend
   already passed and the block is pytest flake/hang only.
5. Verify prod (`/api/version` matches target SHA; SPA HTML / health as needed).

## Never

- Ask “want me to re-run CI / trigger Deploy?” for this class of incident.
- Merge or enable auto-merge (see `no-direct-main-merge`).
